  "body": "https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/14595 introduced ~~a background job~~ code that runs in `DeviceWorkerHandler.check_device_registered` to remove old, non-e2ee devices for users that had >50 devices, in an attempt to reduce the number of devices on homeservers.\r\n\r\nWhen this was applied to matrix.org, it ended up spamming homeservers over federation with device list updates.\r\n\r\nWe may want to consider a rate-limit for the amount of devices we remove in this - and future - cleanup jobs.",
